<p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/032G">Remark <span data-tag="032G">3.4.1.7</span>.</a> A commutative diagram of simplicial sets </p>
<div class="equation">
  \[  \xymatrix@R =50pt@C=50pt{ X_{01} \ar [r] \ar [d] &amp;  X_0 \ar [d] \\ X_1 \ar [r] &amp;  X } \]
</div>
<p> is a homotopy pullback square if and only if the induced diagram of opposite simplicial sets </p>
<div class="equation">
  \[  \xymatrix@R =50pt@C=50pt{ X_{01}^{\operatorname{op}} \ar [r] \ar [d] &amp;  X_0^{\operatorname{op}} \ar [d] \\ X_1^{\operatorname{op}} \ar [r] &amp;  X^{\operatorname{op}} } \]
</div>
<p> is a homotopy pullback square. </p>
